  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_penelope"><head>ΠΗΝΕΛΟΠΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" author_heading="Theopompus" work_heading="Πηνελόπη" starts_on_page="true" ends_on_page="true" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-1">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-1-l1">Καί σε τῇ νουμηνίᾳ</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-1-l2">ἀγαλματίοις ἀγελοῦμεν ἀεὶ καὶ δάφνῃ.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">
                <p>Grammaticus Bekk. Anecd. p. 328 28 de verbo ἀγάλλειν agens: Θεόπομπος Πηνελόπη Καί σε τῇ νουμηνίᾳ κτλ.</p>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" author_heading="Theopompus" work_heading="Πηνελόπη" starts_on_page="true" ends_on_page="true" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-2">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-2-l1">Καὶ τὴν ἱερὰν σφάττουσιν ἡμῶν δέλφακα.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">
                <p>Athenaeus XIV p. 657 a: θηλυκῶς (τὴν δέλφακα) — Θεόπομπος Πηνελόπῃ Καὶ τὴν κτλ.</p>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">
                <p>AB ἡμῶν σφάττουσιν. PVL ἡμῖν σφάττουσιν. Transposuit Iacobsius Addit. p. 344.</p>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" author_heading="Theopompus" work_heading="Πηνελόπη" starts_on_page="true" ends_on_page="true" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-penelope-3">
              <note type="source">
                <p>Athenaeus IV p. 183 f: μνημονεύει δὲ τοῦ τριγώνου τούτου — καὶ Θεόπομπος ἐν Πηνελόπῃ.</p>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>